### Conclusions
**What have you learned?** From this project I have learned how to create a new symbol in KiCAD, and how to display text on the LCD screen.

**How difficult was this assignment?** This assignment was not difficult in concept, just difficult to get to work. I would give the difficulty a 5/10 because of this.

**How did you overcome challenges?** The only challenge I came across was the error message “Exception: No LCD found.” I decided to try a few different things in order to get it to work: I changed out the wires, unplugged and plugged back in all my wires, and I even had to go as far as deleting the “LCD1602.py” and “LCD.py” codes from my Raspberry Pico board. It wasn’t until I did the latter, then re-created the codes, that my LCD displayed my name as intended.


